}^{2}(t).$\n\n- System III is a first-order linear system of ODEs since it can be written in the standard form, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t)=7, &  & b(t)=-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t), &  & f(t)=0, \\\\ c(t)=-1, &  & d(t)=0, &  & g(t)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186314795 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129314 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "66d19e98-522f-5db2-b340-0f35ba2ece23" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Linear System of Differential Equations" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048451 :topic/id #uuid "a0acd569-aa75-5c03-9c8e-bc8f5d31d263" :topic/math-academy-id 2086 :topic/title "Introduction to Systems of Linear ODEs"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6b012cd-e698-5433-b85a-f80e079f8d58" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467088} {:answer/id #uuid "26526a0e-df08-5883-9a41-caed6468ca1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467089}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6b012cd-e698-5433-b85a-f80e079f8d58" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467088} :answer-field/id #uuid "ab37962f-7afc-5c89-9293-8fa76657f729" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468265} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "363d68e8-a43e-5187-8b50-0895370d38bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467090} {:answer/id #uuid "2e1f886f-de76-592c-b0f5-1c949b7d75ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467091}] :answer-field/correct {